{"id":"vremenami","lemma":"временами","pos":"adv","rank":3430,"glosses":["at times, from time to time, now and then, every now and then, now and again, sometimes"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/34/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Том временами странный.","en":"Tom is strange sometimes.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"strange, odd, weird"}]},{"text":"Временами мне грустно.","en":"I feel sad every now and then.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"sadly"}]},{"text":"Ты временами бываешь странный.","en":"You're strange sometimes.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"бывать"},{"g":"strange, odd, weird"}]},{"text":"Завтра будет солнечно, временами дожди.","en":"Tomorrow's weather should be sunny with occasional rain.","words":[{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null,null,{"g":"rain","l":"дождь"}]},{"text":"Временами я впадаю в депрессию.","en":"I get depressed sometimes.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"in"},null]}]}